# Issue #318 regression — sh:class is a repeatable parameter: each
# occurrence is an independent constraint, so a value node must be an
# instance of *every* declared class, not just the first one parsed.
# https://github.com/daghovland/rdf-datalog/issues/318
PREFIX ex: <http://example.com/ns#>

ex:Both a ex:Person, ex:Animal .
ex:OnlyPerson a ex:Person .
